
@NotificationForwarder_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5229

### Health check
GET {{NotificationForwarder_Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Informational notification: accepted without calling the LLM or Discord
POST {{NotificationForwarder_Api_HostAddress}}/notifications
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "level": "info",
  "title": "Deployment completed",
  "message": "Version 1.0.0 was deployed successfully.",
  "source": "release-pipeline"
}